This will be the first signup form which will uses to create a form. Once the details filled up into first create account form, the details will be saved into the database which is postgres. 

Functional Description
Initial account signup endpoint that validates uniqueness, checks password policy requirements, stores user credentials, and initiates email/mobile verification.
System Integration Purpose
Direct user signup / create account entry point for new firm partners and team members.
